Package: rebot-teleop
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: riscv64
Maintainer: Seeed Studio <support@seeed.cc>
Installed-Size: 3450
Depends: 
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Seeed-Solution/rebot-armd
Description: reBot B601-DM arm control daemon (armd) and web cockpit for reCamera
 Runs armd on the reCamera SG2002 with the arm on the B4 board CAN bus
 (Damiao motors), starts a Wi-Fi access point, and serves a browser
 cockpit for teleoperation, object detection overlay, hand-eye calibration
 and tap-to-grasp. Records joint state and commands to Parquet files.
